      "widgets_values": ["# FLUX.2 Klein 9B Mitch Group Scene Studio v1.1 — Visual Presets\n\nClick a group-layout thumbnail in the green node. Each prepared card loads its preserved source photograph, target position, head scale, and tested prompt automatically. The default card is the approved lounge result.\n\nChoose `Custom — uploaded group photo` to use the Load Image node and manual target controls. For a prepared card, the Load Image node is ignored and the text box is optional extra direction.\n\n- Prepared cards: approved lounge, Night out A, Night out B, and the new amber-booth group\n- V3 step-1600 Mitch identity LoRA at `0.90`\n- One genuine front-neutral Mitch reference prevents identity duplication\n- Face-free Canny source controls composition only\n- `832 × 1216`, 50 Euler steps, CFG `4.0`\n- RTX 3090 only\n\nThis revision is a visual-preset interface over the proven internal group-generation engine. It does not use face swap, restoration, sharpening, or a post-generation identity pass. Review every result for exactly one Mitch, correct target selection, head scale, hands, and full-frame integration."],
